As of now, only basic mathematical and logical expressions are
working, as well as the EXIST S keyword;
limit and order by – SPARQL LIMIT expression limits the amount of returned results.

SPARQL ORDER BY expression orders the results of the query by one of the columns
present in the result;
ask query – a SPARQL ASK query is used to determine if a given triple is present in the
ontology;
describe query – a SPARQL DESCRIBE query is used to gather every triple associated
with the elements that it matches with.
